WEBVTT

00:07:56.917 --> 00:08:00.184
sailing through pirate waters
in the Indian Ocean

00:08:00.208 --> 00:08:02.018
with this as a toilet.

00:08:02.042 --> 00:08:03.476
(Laughter)

00:08:03.500 --> 00:08:05.125
Can you guys see this?

00:08:07.125 --> 00:08:10.542
You know how everybody has
their worst toilet story?

00:08:11.875 --> 00:08:14.875
Well, I've never swam
with dolphins before.

00:08:16.333 --> 00:08:18.518
I just went straight to pooping on them.

00:08:18.542 --> 00:08:20.917
(Laughter)

00:08:23.375 --> 00:08:30.101
And also, I genuinely discovered
that I am genuinely less stressed